%% UI owners: packages/message/src/lib/services/toolbar-command/commands/expedited.command.ts:1；src/pages/message-v3/message.component.ts:1；packages/message/src/lib/components/chat-standalone/chat-container-standalone/chat-container-standalone.component.ts:1；src/app/message-host/runtime/im-gate/helix/helixTauriImGate.service.ts:1（实际命令与关联回灌）
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate Port
  participant Native as Tauri Native
  participant FFI as Flutter FFI
  participant Web as Browser Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant PS as Pending or local state
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink raw bytes
  Note over UI,Gate: 用户目标：成员对自己发的消息点「加急」，从未读名单里勾人，被勾中的人收到强提醒和一条待办
  Note over UI,Web: 合同登记快照（不等于当前实现或实测）：mock=implemented；helix=full；dual=yes；personaLocal=no；该图是交互合同，不把 Mock、HTTP 2xx 或静态注册写成真实 Green
  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: urgentPost(payload)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_urgent_post", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Flutter FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_urgent_post", payload)
  else Browser Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_urgent_post", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: ExecutionShell::step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 对指定未读成员加急 的入参，生成 corr_key/req_id
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST /posts/urgentPost
  Host->>Go: HTTP request with tenant/auth/corr headers
  Go-->>Host: HTTP response（2xx 只代表 admission/query response）
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(http)
  E->>IM: correlate req_id/corr_key
  Go-->>WS: WS authority event or canonical result
  WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(authority bytes)
  E->>IM: apply authoritative event before settlement
  IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(projection + cursor)
  Host->>DB: transaction message + channel + viewer member + cursor
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(PersistOk)
  E->>IM: release only matching authority corr
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist ScopedGet(readback)
  Host->>DB: durable readback
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
  E->>IM: readback is the projection source
  IM->>Sink: Effect::Emit {event,data}（im:post:updated，im:channel:update）
  Sink-->>UI: Native im:__bus__ 原始事件 → adapter 映射 kind → Angular 消费
  Sink-->>FFI: FFI batch raw {event,data}
  Sink-->>Web: Web EventBatch raw {event,data}
  alt HTTP / PortReply / Persist error
    IM->>IM: keep prior durable state；attach structured error to corr_key
    IM-->>E: Err or correlated error result
    E-->>Gate: controlled failure
    Gate-->>UI: error / empty state；不得伪造成功事件
  end
  Note over IM,DB: 关键效果：msg.expediteRecipients = 过滤后 targetIds.map(id =大于 (id, name, status:0, teamId))；msg.expediteSender = id:self,...；props.urgent=true 且 props.urgentTargets = 过滤后 targetIds；所属频道 channel.urgentPostList 加入被加急 postId（去重）+ channel.urgentCurrentName = 加急发起人显示名 + channel.hasUrgentPost = true；这是会话列表闪电/头像红框/顶替未读角标的权威源（dialog-item.component.ts:35-40 只读 urgentPostList，不读 urgentCount）。已修（原为缺口）：mockImG；被加急的对端读到自己在 expediteRecipients 中且 status===0（isBeurged() 命中 → 气泡出现「已读」按钮）；只读依赖：加急弹窗的未读名单 = readBits 中为 '0' 的位 → 映射成员快照同位序元素；本 Gate 不改写任何位
  Note over UI,Web: 关键负向：不得写 channel.urgentCount（死字段，会话列表不读——dialog-item 只读 urgentPostList，写入会造成双源；urgentPost 全程 urgentCount 保持 undefined）；isUrgent() / isBeurged() 读 msg.expediteRecipients（数组，find status===0）而非 props.urgent —— 只写 props.urgent 不得视为加急生效，断言必须查 expediteRecipients；targetIds 中的 undefined / 空串必须在 map 前 filter，禁止把 undefined 展开进 expediteRecipients（spread 前 filter undefined 雷区）
  Note over E,Sink: 原始事件名（按触发分支）：im:post:updated，im:channel:update；客户端 kind/action 由 adapter 映射，不是原始 Emit 名称
